{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36654","headline":"寄南城韦逸人 · 罗隐","name":"寄南城韦逸人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杜甫诗中韦曲花，至今无赖尚豪家。\n美人晓折露沾袖，公子醉时香满车。\n万里丹青传不得，二年风雨恨无涯。\n羡他南涧高眠客，春去春来任物华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}